    <main>
      <h1>Best CRM Software in 2026</h1>
      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 3+ vendors · Business Tools Pillar · CRM Category</div>

      <p>The right CRM turns scattered spreadsheets and inbox conversations into a structured revenue engine. The wrong CRM collects dust because your sales team refuses to log in. HubSpot and Salesforce dominate 2026 evaluations, but the right choice depends on your team size, complexity, and whether you have a dedicated RevOps or admin function. We ranked the leading CRMs on ease of onboarding, pricing transparency, workflow automation depth, reporting, integration ecosystem, and real-world adoption rates.</p>
      <p>For the full head-to-head on the market leaders, read <a href="/reviews/hubspot-vs-salesforce/">HubSpot vs Salesforce: Best CRM Platform 2026</a>. Also explore the <a href="/reviews/business-tools/">Business Tools Pillar</a> for email marketing and document workflow comparisons.</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#how-we-evaluated">How We Evaluated</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ranking-methodology">Ranking Methodology</a></li>
          <li><a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-small-business-hubspot">#1 — HubSpot (Best for Small Business)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-enterprise-salesforce">#2 — Salesforce (Best for Enterprise)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-alternatives">#3 — CRM Alternatives (Pipedrive / Zoho / Freshworks)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#crm-selection-scenarios">CRM Selection Scenarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buying-guide">Buying Guide</a></li>
